Dear {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.CreatedBy},

You have successfully submitted the following Product Access Request (PAR):

PAR #: {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Name}
PAR Approval Org: {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Core_Support_Org_Name__c}
PAR Submitter: {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.CreatedBy}
PAR Submitter Comments: {!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Core_Submitter_Comments__c}

Each PAR can have multiple Line Items and each Line Item may or may not require approval.  To review your Product Access Request and the approval status for each Line Item please follow the link: {!$Label.Core_IPS_Notification_Internal_URL}/{!Core_IPS_MAP_PAR__c.Id}

Note if you have created a PAR that was submitted to multiple Product Support Organizations you will receive multiple PAR notifications, one for each Organization.

